# Cheap, auto-refreshed api-mode caches: re-pulled from the API on each run, so
# a committed copy would just go stale. (charts.json, unlock_folders.txt, and
# tech_population.json stay tracked as bundled artifacts -- the first two are the
# static catalog; tech_population.json is ~400 live requests to rebuild, so it
# ships built and stamped with its spice basis instead of refreshing per run.)
